          "title": "You'll want to know: सवेरा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सवेरा — saverā — \"early morning, daybreak\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हम सवेरे पाँच बजे निकले। ham savere pā̃c baje nikle. We set off at five in the early morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
