          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सवेरा (saverā) goes back to savēla, \"in time, early\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 13291), which lists Hindi saverā, \"early morning\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
